              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfunye kizongona chekora chikaie irumba jimnukiagha BWANA nicha. Mfunye wana wa njau wawi, bauru imweri, na wana wa ng'ondi mfungade wa womi wa mwaka ghumweri wisewadie itiko jingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wokoni mfunye kizongona cha viro, kilo idadu ra mufu ghudendere ghuranganyiro na mavuda kwa kula njau, na kilo iwi kwa bauru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
